--- !u!114 &114063066327270234
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1856782090799894}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 640
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 面对如此广袤的一片海域，但肉眼之所及，神识之所至，却只有惊涛迭起的深蓝大海。既不见海兽，亦难寻修士，倒是有两者的残躯飘扬在怒涛之上，静默地承受着夹杂魔气的灼热不祥灵气中。
